My Commands

*  1. List Files                   List all files with details
*  2. Disk Usage                   Show disk usage
   3. Docker Build                 Build Docker image with tag
   4. Docker Run                   Run Docker container interactively
   5. Git Pull                     Pull from remote branch
   6. Git Push                     Push to remote branch
   7. Git Status                   Show git status
   8. NPM Install                  Install npm package
   9. Show Path                    Show PATH environment variable

↑↓: Navigate | Enter/1-9: Select | f: Favorite | a: Add | d: Delete | e: Edit | c: Clone | /: Search | Ctrl+C: Quit
